                                                "example_id": "774cc123-a959-4074-96ec-9bcfdbcfb524",
                                                "sense_id": "1f96db0a-b510-3d11-aa81-b268c1a6cd63",
                                                "text": "a hair and beauty salon"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85d35dec-0496-4731-9e19-90138c746528",
                                                "sense_id": "1f96db0a-b510-3d11-aa81-b268c1a6cd63",
                                                "text": "When the beauty team departs the set, the AD will say, “Let’s go on a bell.” A bell sounds throughout the stage, and […]"
